      "impact": "An extra, firmware‑unmanaged I2C device (TF‑Luna) is placed on the main I2C bus, contrary to the documented r2 build. If the module is populated it loads the bus and presents an address the firmware does not expect, deviating from the intended (unwired) behaviour.",
